{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"clay_lump","model_identifier":"clay_lump","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## clay_lump\n\nCarried load, clay.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.0..4.8, y -3.0..3.2, z -7.7..-0.5 (size 9.8 x 6.2 x 7.2 u = 28 x 18 x 20 cm).\nClay lump: a smooth, wet grey-brown slab of dug clay with finger marks. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## clay_lump\n\nCarried load, clay.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -5.0..4.8, y -3.0..3.2, z -7.7..-0.5 (size 9.8 x 6.2 x 7.2 u = 28 x 18 x 20 cm).\nClay lump: a smooth, wet grey-brown slab of dug clay with finger marks. Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"rock","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,-3.0,-7.5],"to":[4.0,2.0,-0.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,0,24.0,5.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,7,7.0,12.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[24,0,32.0,5.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[7,7,14.0,12.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,8.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8,0,16.0,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4f5cad22-f650-56a2-a567-6895ffc803ea"},{"name":"rock_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","al